  "title": "The power of simplicity: Lessons from unscripted Apple Immersive titles",
  "description": "Discover techniques on how to craft compelling, unscripted immersive stories. This session explores how to create natural, grounded framing, choose viewer-comfortable distances and heights, and use spatial audio to guide attention. You’ll also learn why building trust with subjects is essential, especially when immersive shots are longer and place people at the heart of the experience.\n\nThis session was originally presented as part of the Meet with Apple activity “Create immersive media experiences for visionOS - Day 2.” Watch the full video for more insights and related sessions.",
